	// ------------------------------------------------------------------
	// Era aug boost (LDoN -> UF): raise the era-defining augmentations to
	// the soul-aug standard (Lost-soul caps: era targets L65=283, L70=305,
	// L75=327, L80=348, L85=370 hp+mana+ac; source tiers 50/75/100%).
	// Covers Wayfarer-camp stock, the LDoN venture tail, Stones/Fabled,
	// the TBS-UF named-drop progression, and the epic quest augs (Jonas
	// Dagmire's bones, Black Gemstones, Shield of the Otherworld).
	// Every UPDATE covers base + (Enchanted)/(Legendary) tier rows.
	// Sentinel: Solid Coal of Prowess (42205) hp = 283 after the boost.
	// RUN-ONCE: multiplicative scaling -- the check must gate it.
