	// utils/sql/20261023_por_theme_completion.sql (part 1/12, section tasks)
	// PoR theme completion vs Rasper's Realm: 12 tasks (303187-303198), 100
	// rares/named/raid npcs (1120002200-2299) + spawns + loot across relic/
