	// utils/sql/20261025_ro_legacy_zone_retirement.sql
	// The engine cannot load 'northro' (392) / 'southro' (393) — it bounces
	// players to classic nro (34) / sro (35). Retire the legacy zones:
	// 1. All zone_points lines targeting 392/393 retargeted to 34/35
	//    (freeporteast/freeportsewers/commonlands/oldcommons/southro lines,
	//    both generations).
	// 2. Unique named NPCs stranded in the dead zones moved into the retro
	//    zones (LDoN-era uniques with no retro twin): the Takish queen,
	//    translocators, Ro heroes (Dorn_B`Dynn, Tak`Valnakor, Cazel),
	//    Herald_of_the_Triumvirate, the Tran merchants, innkeeps, guards, and
	//    the Erollisi Aspect + party machine (blessing-task targets). Camp NPCs
	//    that already exist in the retro zones were left (no duplicates).
	// 3. task_activities zones '393' -> '35' (task 3019, blessing 700127/
	//    700136/700208) — '392' rows were already fixed in v235.
	// 4. The two IT63 actor-pad objects (bonfire candidates for task 700208
	//    "bonfire of South Ro") moved into sro.
	// 5. Takish_Porter (clone of PoR_Porter) added in sro beside the other
	//    porters; its quest script (quests/sro/Takish_Porter.lua) gates on PoR
