	// utils/sql/20261025_quellious_karana_quest_polish.sql
	// Quellious/Karana blessing-quest polish from live testing:
	// 1. Nettle_Higglesbury + the angry-farmer group raised z 64 -> 74 (still
	//    under the misty terrain at 64; user-verified floor).
	// 2. New spell 44031 "Karanite Rainfall" (clone of Wake of Karana 1725) for
	//    the True Karanite Rod of Rainfall: a self-cast that starts rain.
	//    NOTE: this entry's effectid1 = 528 was wrong -- 528 is live EQ's
	//    "Clear Faction" SPA. Entry 256 makes the spell effectless and moves
	//    the weather into global/spells/44031.pl.
